VALUES ('2b9d900f-8802-5fc5-bb31-d1d5a6187daa', 'f79dff32-ef9f-5686-a953-31ef46f1f3e5', 'text', 'Vocabulary', '{"text": "## School Subjects\n\n**Subject** — An area of study.\n_What is your favorite subject?_\n\n**Math** — Study of numbers and logic.\n_Math is very important._\n\n**Science** — Study of the natural world.\n_I like science experiments._\n\n**Art** — Painting and drawing.\n_Art class is very colorful._\n\n**Music** — Study of songs and instruments.\n_We study music on Friday._\n\n**History** — Study of the past.\n_History is very interesting._\n\n**English** — The language of study.\n_We speak English in class._\n\n**Sport** — Physical activity.\n_We have sport on Tuesday._\n\n**Favorite** — The one you like the most.\n_My favorite subject is Math._\n\n**Like** — Finding something pleasant.\n_I like science very much._\n"}', 0, NOW(), NOW())
ON CONFLICT (id) DO NOTHING;
