VALUES ('c8a2c4d1-290e-5a4e-b87d-7af6887c70af', '2fcd64e3-49d6-5567-a9e4-90b03b77fc74', 'text', 'Vocabulary', '{"text": "## Describing Progress\n\n**Easy** — Simple to do.\n_Learning English is easy for you._\n\n**Hard** — Requires much work.\n_Math is hard, but I study._\n\n**Fast** — Making progress quickly.\n_You read very fast._\n\n**Slow** — Taking time to learn.\n_It is okay to be slow._\n\n**Well** — Doing something correctly.\n_You speak English very well._\n\n**Improve** — Getting better.\n_I want to improve my writing._\n\n**Perfect** — Without any mistakes.\n_That sentence is perfect._\n\n**Good** — Satisfactory or better.\n_Your grade is very good._\n\n**Skill** — Something you can do.\n_Reading is a useful skill._\n\n**Goal** — What you want to reach.\n_My goal is to learn more._\n"}', 0, NOW(), NOW())
ON CONFLICT (id) DO NOTHING;
