VALUES ('d3c33bf8-e836-5dfb-a80d-b83c7625e167', '67c20306-83c8-5945-92bd-0d13c0a0479a', 'text', 'Vocabulary', '{"text": "## School Events\n\n**Event** — A special activity.\n_The school event is on Friday._\n\n**Party** — A fun celebration.\n_We have a party after class._\n\n**Trip** — Traveling with the class.\n_Our school trip is next month._\n\n**Game** — A fun competitive activity.\n_We play a game today._\n\n**Join** — To become part of an activity.\n_Join us for the meeting._\n\n**Invite** — Asking someone to come.\n_I invite you to the party._\n\n**Date** — The day on the calendar.\n_What is the date today?_\n\n**Time** — The clock hour.\n_The event time is two o''clock._\n\n**Place** — Where it happens.\n_The place is the school gym._\n\n**Fun** — Enjoying the activity.\n_The game was very fun._\n"}', 0, NOW(), NOW())
ON CONFLICT (id) DO NOTHING;
