VALUES ('b09b4592-7ed9-5140-9002-2d33ce4b9a73', 'beb8c618-2c2a-5671-a57f-8d4ff6c38158', 'text', 'Vocabulary', '{"text": "## Future Ambitions\n\n**Future** — Time that is still to come.\n_I have big plans for my future._\n\n**Goal** — Something you work to achieve.\n_My main goal is to be a teacher._\n\n**Dream** — A strong wish for the future.\n_It is my dream to study abroad._\n\n**Plan** — A set of steps to reach a goal.\n_I have a plan to learn English._\n\n**Work** — Putting effort into a job.\n_I want to work in a big office._\n\n**Career** — A long-term professional job.\n_I am starting my new career._\n\n**Success** — Achieving what you wanted.\n_I am working hard for my success._\n\n**Learn** — The process to get there.\n_I learn every day._\n\n**Study** — Preparing for your career.\n_I study to get a better job._\n\n**Achieve** — To finish a goal.\n_I want to achieve my dreams._\n"}', 0, NOW(), NOW())
ON CONFLICT (id) DO NOTHING;
